54.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115254.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-29T00:03:45Z"},"body":"Bit of a weird edge case that discovered this issue but it is possible we do not have a valid depth format suitable for XR.\r\n\r\nNow we only care about this if we're planning to submit the depth buffer, and the code already supports that if we don't have a valid depth format, we disable submitting it. We just use our own depth buffer that we do not submit in this scenario.\r\n\r\nHowever the check for depth buffer format was always executed, and would always lead to an error that stops initialisation.\r\n\r\nThis PR changes this so we only check the depth buffer format if we need to, and treats it like a warning if we don't have one.\r\n\r\nNote: also cleaned up some very outdated comments.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115254/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi